	"content": "# B\"H\n\n# Ohr HaGnuz Expansion Brainstorm\n\nThe goal is not to copy Pokemon or RuneScape; the goal is to make a single-player Torah-soul RPG with the research, exploration, collection, combat, skilling, and quest depth that makes those games feel infinite.\n\n</Core Pillars>\n\n1. World\n- Multi-region open world: village, beist midrash, forest, orchard, river, cave, desert, midbar, shok, migdal, palace, sky gates, hidden sefiros chambers.\n - Travel gates: doors, region edges, portals, skill-locked gates, quest-locked gardens.\n- Random events: wild musagim, lost scrolls, singing trees, wandering magiggidim.\n\n2. Collection\n- Wild musagim as concept-creatures that can be studied, sweetened, indexed, and used to unlock quests (not captured, but revealed).\n- Musag dex with question label, place found, development stage, sweetening date.\n- Iron/bronze/silver/gold mastery for each musag.\n\n3. Battle\n- Pokemon-style battle screen: two visible sides, bars, EXP, menu, status, animations.\n- RuneScape-style skill contribution: chochmah damage, binah defense, daat critical, niggun heal, hitbonenus evade.\n- Tempo system: attack, defend, meditate, niggun, source, svara.\n- Status: dazed, awe, shattered, fervor, joy, silence, ohr chozer, hitaapachut.\n - Enemy AI: logical opponents choose moves based on player status.\n\n4. Skills\n- Skills like RuneScape: Learning, Writing, Niggun, Hitbonenus, Chesed, Gevurah, Tiferet, Netzach, Hod, Yesod, Malchus.\n- Each skill has level, exp, nextExp, and perks.\n- World actions grant skill EXP: read scroll, collect spark, fixbridge, meditate at tree, sing at river.\n\n5. Items\n- Inventory: sparks, scrolls, keys, chests, lamps, tools, forged letters, food, niggun shards.\n- Garments: equipment that changes appearance, stats, moves, and battle effects.\n- Tools: pen, lamp, kleiznemer, forge hammer, bridge nusach.\n\n6. Quests\n- Main quest: gather hidden light through seven regions.\n- Region quests: village, beist midrash, forest, river, cave, orchard, forge, ruins.\n - Side quests: NPC memories, skill tutorials, rare musagim, reward garments.\n - Quest chains with prerequisites and stages.\n\n7. NNCs\n- Every NPC has unique glyph, story, quest, battle or skill function.\n - NPC story progresses as quests complete.\n- Some NPCs are shops, trainers, teleporters, skill masters, secret-path guides.\n\n8. UI/\u0015T\nKH\u0013Z[�[X\\\u000b���\u0005\u0017VW7B\u0006��r��\u00056����\u0007\u0006\u0016�V���\u0004��fV�F�'�\u0007\u0006\u0016�V���\u0004�W6\u0016r\u0006FW���\u0004&\u0017GF�R\u000767&VV�\u0007v�F�\u0006��fW2�\u00077F\u0017GW2�\u0006&\u0017'2�\u0006\u0016��\u0017F���2��\u0005\u0007&W6WB\u0007FW7B\u0006�V�S�\u0007FW7B\u0006F��'2�\u0006f�&W7B�\u0006w&\u001772�\u0007G&\u0016��W\"�\u0006֖Fv\u0016�R�\u0006&�72ࠣ��\u0004\u0017WF��\u0017F���\u0006\u0016�B\u0005FW7F��p��\u0004\u0017WF��v\u0016Ʋ\u0006'�\u00066Ɩ6���\u0005\u0007&W6WB\u0007\u0006\u0017F�2\u0006f�\"\u0006F��'2�\u0006VFvW2�\u0006w&\u001772�\u0004�\u000472�\u0006�FV�2��\u00056���R\u0007FW7G2\u0006f�\"\u0006&\u0017GF�W2�\u0007\u0006�'F\u0016�2�\u0007\u0017VW7G2�\u00076����2�\u0006�\u0017\u0002\u0006��\u0016F��r��\u0004&�B\u0007\u0006�\u0017�FW7B\u0006g&��\u0007f���\u0016vR\u0007F�\u0006֖Fv\u0016�Rࠣ\u0013\u0002\u00056\u0017fR���\u0016@��\u0004��6\u0016�7F�&\u0016vR\u00076\u0017fR��\u0004\u0017WF�6\u0017fR\u0006\u0016gFW\"\u0007\u0017VW7B\u00066��\u0006�WF����\u0006v\u0017&�V�B\u0007V���6��\u0006�WfV�\u0007W\u0002��\u0004W�\u0006�'B���\u0006�'B\u00076\u0017fR\u00066�FRࠤ��\u0006�V�V�F\u0017F���\u0006�&FW#��\u0012�\u00056����2\u0006f�V�F\u0017F����\"�\u00056����\u0004U�\u0002\u0007v�&VB\u0006��F�\u0006&\u0017GF�W2\u0006\u0016�B\u0006�FV�2�2�\u0004�W6\u0016r\u0006FW�\u0006f�V�F\u0017F����B�\u0005T�\u0006�fW&�\u0017�\u0006f�\"\u00076����2�\u0007\u0017VW7G2�\u0006��fV�F�'��R�\u0004V�Vג\u0004\u0014�\u0006\u0016�B\u00077F\u0017GW2\u0006��fW2�b�\u0004��&R\u0006�\u0017\u00072\u0006\u0016�B\u0007\u0017VW7B\u00066�\u0016��2�r�\u00056\u0017